# Admin panel

Before editing this project, follow `AGENTS.md`. The Persian twin is `AGENTS.fa.md`. Human setup is `README.md` and `README.fa.md`.

- UI copy stays Persian. Routes, permission keys, and JSON fields stay English.
- Call the API only through `lib/http.ts` and `lib/endpoints.ts`. Read `response.items`.
- Register a new screen in `components/nav.ts` and gate actions with `useAuth().can`.
- Keep login submit disabled until the mobile, password, or 5-digit code is valid.
- Do not show پاگرد on the login page.
- Use the theme tokens in `app/globals.css`. Do not hard-code surface colors.
- Typecheck with `./node_modules/.bin/tsc --noEmit`, then exercise the changed flow in the browser on port 3001.
